990
01:21:46.109 --> 01:21:48.108
But I'm not fighting you.

991
01:21:49.609 --> 01:21:51.734
And I accept, totally,
everything you've got to do.

992
01:21:51.816 --> 01:21:53.609
I accept it. Totally.

993
01:21:57.482 --> 01:21:58.733
Oh, yeah?

994
01:22:01.025 --> 01:22:02.149
Yeah.

995
01:22:07.149 --> 01:22:11.773
Well, you say all that fucking stuff,
I can't fucking shoot you now, can I?

996
01:22:13.148 --> 01:22:15.648
It's entirely up to you, Harry.

997
01:22:15.732 --> 01:22:17.690
It's entirely your call.

998
01:22:19.273 --> 01:22:22.106
All I'm saying is I'm not fighting.

999
01:22:29.481 --> 01:22:31.106
Oh, you fucking cunt!

1000
01:22:31.190 --> 01:22:32.398
Look, I'm not gonna do nothing to you

1001
