1014
01:23:08.728 --> 01:23:10.479
That's just cocaine.

1015
01:23:10.561 --> 01:23:12.978
He didn't even want
the Vietnamese on his side!

1016
01:23:13.061 --> 01:23:15.187
That's just cocaine.

1017
01:23:16.144 --> 01:23:19.852
Listen, we're filming down
by the pointy building tonight.

1018
01:23:19.935 --> 01:23:22.436
It might actually be good for once.

1019
01:23:23.769 --> 01:23:25.852
You guys should come along.

1020
01:23:25.935 --> 01:23:30.644
We... I think we're just gonna have
a quiet one tonight, Jimmy.

1021
01:23:32.644 --> 01:23:34.311
That's how it is!

1022
01:23:36.311 --> 01:23:37.935
In another life.

1023
01:23:44.727 --> 01:23:46.809
They're great, aren't they?

1024
01:24:01.933 --> 01:24:04.475
You didn't. You didn't!

1025
01:24:45.431 --> 01:24:46.723
