1067
01:33:45.981 --> 01:33:49.107
But could you just get out
of the fucking way, please?

1068
01:33:54.022 --> 01:33:55.189
Marie!

1069
01:33:56.189 --> 01:33:58.522
Just let him come up, it's okay.

1070
01:33:58.605 --> 01:34:01.855
Harry, swear not to start shooting
