1071
01:34:01.939 --> 01:34:05.355
I swear not to start shooting
till she's left the hotel. I totally swear.

1072
01:34:05.438 --> 01:34:07.854
Well, I'm not going anywhere.

1073
01:34:07.938 --> 01:34:10.105
This is my hotel.

1074
01:34:10.188 --> 01:34:11.938
