Why don't you both put your guns down
and go home?

1078
01:34:34.603 --> 01:34:37.645
Don't be stupid. This is the shootout.

1079
01:34:39.311 --> 01:34:42.395
- Harry, I've got an idea.
- What?

1080
01:34:42.478 --> 01:34:44.686
My room faces onto the canal, right?

1081
01:34:44.769 --> 01:34:47.478
I'm gonna go back to me room,
jump into the canal,

1082
01:34:47.560 --> 01:34:49.644
