1089
01:35:02.893 --> 01:35:04.185
I completely promise, Harry.

1090
01:35:04.267 --> 01:35:06.559
I'm not gonna risk
having another little kid die, am I?

1091
01:35:06.643 --> 01:35:10.809
So, hang on, I go outside,
then I go which way, right or left?

1092
01:35:10.892 --> 01:35:12.351
You go right, don't you?

1093
01:35:12.434 --> 01:35:15.392
You can see it from the doorway!
It's a big fucking canal!

1094
01:35:15.475 --> 01:35:18.433
All right. Jesus!
I've only just got here, haven't I?

1095
01:35:18.517 --> 01:35:21.350
Okay.
On a count of "one, two, three, go," okay?

1096
01:35:21.433 --> 01:35:22.558
Okay.

1097
01:35:28.475 --> 01:35:31.225
- What? Who says it?
- Oh, you say it.

1098
01:35:31.308 --> 01:35:33.225
You guys are crazy.

1099
01:35:33.308 --> 01:35:34.684
- Are you ready?
- Ready.

1100
01:35:34.767 --> 01:35:36.308
