1113
01:40:10.290 --> 01:40:14.290
<i>And I thought, "If I survive all this,
I'll go to that house,</i>

1114
01:40:14.374 --> 01:40:16.124
<i>"apologise to the mother there,</i>

1115
01:40:16.207 --> 01:40:19.623
<i>"and accept whatever punishment
she chose for me."</i>

1116
01:40:19.707 --> 01:40:23.040
<i>Prison, death, it didn't matter.</i>

1117
01:40:24.373 --> 01:40:27.666
<i>Because at least in prison
and at least in death, you know,</i>

1118
01:40:27.748 --> 01:40:30.124
<i>I wouldn't be in fucking Bruges.</i>

1119
01:40:32.581 --> 01:40:36.623
<i>But then, like a flash, it came to me,
and I realised,</i>

1120
01:40:38.956 --> 01:40:41.581
<i>"Fuck, man, maybe that's what Hell is.</i>

1121
01:40:43.164 --> 01:40:46.455
<i>"The entire rest of eternity
spent in fucking Bruges!"</i>

1122
01:40:51.330 --> 01:40:54.163
<i>And I really, really hoped I wouldn't die.</i>

1123
01:40:56.788 --> 01:40:59.371
<i>I really, really hoped I wouldn't die.</i>
